{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁ私はテストに追われてテスト勉強頑張っております。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやぁわからない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分で、ここ迄したらご褒美にゲームを少ししよう〜とか、ここ迄したらTVみよう〜！ってやってたら..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気付けばテレビみてたり携帯イジイジしていたりと......あれ？勉強しなくちゃ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"汗汗\nってなってしまったり..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"汗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以前質問で、どうやったら集中して勉強できる？って言われてたけど、難しいよね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"汗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね♪\n友達が頭良いので問題とか分からないところは学校終わって教えてもらったり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家で勉強する時は連絡して写真送ったり、\n音声で会話して教わっております"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント読んでたら、同じように試験中だったり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"身体に気を付けて頑張ってって書いあったり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやが頑張ってるから自分も頑張る！って書いてあったり..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日の方も...\n大阪公演行けないけど応援してくれてたり..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逢えるのを楽しみにしてくれてたり..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと、みなみちゃまとユッキーナfamilyの皆様コメントありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと、何度もコメントしてもいいですか？の質問は..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん!!凄く嬉しいです(T^T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヤル気パワーをいつもいつも本当にありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやぁ私は恵まれてるなぁ......涙\n頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆のところにも沢山のパワーが届きますように"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ絶対まあや探せないなっ=^∀^=ドヤッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美雲ちゃん♪\n誕生日おめでとーうっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頭も良くて英語もペラペラで、でも一番は、優しい!!素敵なお姉ちゃまです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な1年になりますように♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ傘の忘れ物してるよ〜笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また遊びにきてね〜美雲ちゃ〜ん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐ、なあちゃんの誕生日だね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それはまだだから、また書きます♪\n大好きな\nなあちゃんの誕生日がもうすぐだよ〜(^〇^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度、お父さんとお母さんが横浜に来るから、まあやも時間があえば会いに行こう〜！って思ってるんだけど、\n横浜での美味しい食べ物ってなんだろう？？\n美味しいお店屋さん知ってる？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/22/2292517/0004.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}